C419 [*] Unnecessary list comprehension
 --> C419_py315.py:3:5
  |
1 | xs = [[1], [2]]
2 |
3 | all([*x for x in xs])
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
4 | any({*x for x in xs})
